WEBVTT

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.390
Vincent-san!  Isshin-san!

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:37.870
Don't!  Hartman!

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:38.770
Hurry!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:42.140
Charl.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.230
Thank goodness.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.310
Please calm down and listen to me.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.460
What is it?

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.320
Hartman...it seems that he was killed.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.590
Hartman...it seems that he was killed.

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:00.770
Then, I'll see you later.  Tomorrow at school, like usual?

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:01.830
Yeah.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.140
See you later.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:04.650
Be careful.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.730
Teppei-sama!

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.220
Yuu-san.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.490
Hey, how long are you going to hug him?!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.340
Father.

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:34.790
Silvie.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:36.680
Thank goodness.

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:41.720
With everyone's help, we were able to protect Arima Hills.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.770
I, Arima Isshin, give you gratitude from the bottom of my heart.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.480
Hazelrink's escort will arrive shortly.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.310
Where is the Princess?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.800
Charl was just picked up by a car a moment ago.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.770
I heard you sent the car.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:58.820
What?

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.280
Was that Alfred?

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.890
The only one I contacted was Alf.

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:14.670
No way...tell me it's not true.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.310
Charl...

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:56.680
Is it okay your plan is only half successful, Hartman-sama?

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.720
That's how it goes.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.050
Hartman!

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.550
What's wrong with Onee-chan?  She has a scary expression.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.180
It's a success.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.990
It's just a matter of time before it hits the charts.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:39.620
The TV...

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.190
Seika-sama, what is the problem?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.410
Wait, Charl, do you understand the situation?

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:00.900
Everything's fine.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.880
I'm sure Teppei will definately be able to do something about it.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.140
What do you mean 'do something about it'?!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:10.970
I couldn't even save <i>her</i> in the end!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:16.360
The people who kidnapped Charl are probably the same people from the other day.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:22.350
The airport's main camera managed to capture images of the suspect.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.050
Impossible!

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:28.390
He should have been shot dead back then.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.600
It means it was all an elaborate ploy.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:36.270
Which means we were easily deceived.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:40.160
If that's true, Princess Charlotte has...

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.320
The probability is high.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.740
I...

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:48.860
Teppei-kun, I understand your feelings, but this is already an international issue.

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:52.940
It's not a problem at a level where you can help.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:55.750
So are you saying we should just stand by and watch?!

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:59.130
Father, I'm thinking the same thing as Houjouin.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.480
This is a situation where we are unsure of how many enemies we may face.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.090
What could you guys do in such a place?

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:17.900
Teppei...

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.780
Yes, what is it?

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.030
Please don't forget about me.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:25.910
Huh?

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:30.580
Please don't erase the memories of me in your heart.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.430
What happened?!

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:40.380
It's not like you at all, Arima-sama.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.860
Please tell me everything!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.470
If you have any problems, share them with me, Nezu, Nezu Haruhiko!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.830
A-Arima-sama?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.580
Oh, good afternoon!

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.150
I wonder if it's too early to say good evening.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.050
Where is this?

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:25.360
Ah!  What's my name, anyway?

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:25.970
No way!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:27.840
I lied.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:28.990
Charlotte,

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.470
Charlotte Hazelrink.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:32.850
Nice to meet you.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.860
Guess who?

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:38.770
I told you!  I'm a brand new transfer student!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.890
You are...

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.390
You're boring.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.350
If you can't even address me properly once, I don't think it's destiny.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.190
Just kidding!

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:53.260
I'm Charlotte Hazelrink.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:55.110
We meet again!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.500
Charl...  Charl!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:18.550
Charl!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.410
Charl!

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.010
<i>Teppei!</i>

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.450
<i>Charl!</i>

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.560
Teppei!

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:49.480
Teppei!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.490
Charlotte.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.450
That's right...

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.150
Before I knew it...there was a place in my heart...for Charlotte.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.210
You have awakened, my fiancée.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:29.690
Hartman, they said you were dead...

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:35.100
My my, it's your punishment for acting like a princess.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:41.810
Unfortunately, I'm going to eliminate your precious friend.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:43.440
That Arima Teppei.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.690
I'm going to crush the Arima family, you see.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.330
Why Teppei?

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:52.070
It's because he became the successor of Arima.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:56.560
That's why I'll destroy him.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.990
And with that, it'll lead Arima Isshin to despair.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:04.060
D-Don't tell me, Arima Hills was your...?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.040
That is correct.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.030
W-Why would you do that...?

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:13.130
Arima Isshin owes a large debt.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.120
Just shaming him is not enough.

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:22.200
That is why I'll showcase his shame throughout the whole world, and then take everything.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:23.820
What are you talking about?

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.000
It's okay if you don't understand.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.720
Hartman!  Hartman!

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.720
Don't take your eyes off her.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:28.720
Yes sir!

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:33.740
Excuse me...

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:35.950
It's been a while.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.590
You guys are the ones from Hills...

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:40.460
Does the rope hurt?

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:45.720
It hurts!  It hurts!  It really hurts!

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:45.630
I'm so sorry it's so tight.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.750
H-Hold on, I'll loosen it.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.750
It hurts!  It hurts!

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:48.880
Please keep this a secret.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.700
Thank you, you really are good people.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:56.360
I-It's okay.  Is there anything you want to eat?

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.730
Takoyaki.  Takoyaki!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:02.960
Takoyaki, takoyaki!  I want to see Teppei!

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.600
We have just received some information.

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:09.730
Charlotte-sama is being confined in the state guest train.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.610
Is it the Grand Hazelrink?

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:14.670
Yes, we thought that it went missing.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:20.450
But it was signed out to Charlotte-sama by a retainer.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:24.180
I see.  Her own country cannot make an announcement.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.210
Is that information passed from a trustworthy route?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.330
I won't claim to vouch for that.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:34.940
However, this is really all the information we have.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:37.950
In any case, Teppei-dono is the key?

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.770
But Teppei-sama is...

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:44.920
I know.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.880
Just as I thought.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:56.760
Seika-san.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.120
What's with that depressed face?

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:01.820
What do you think you're doing slipping out of class?

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.430
Did you think of a way to save Charl?

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:06.710
It's impossible.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:09.990
Charl is heading towards Hazelrink by now.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:14.560
Vincent-san said it's no longer something I can handle.

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:15.630
Are you stupid?!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.990
So what if she's at Hazelrink?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:19.330
Not something you can handle?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:20.010
What's with that?

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:25.040
Where's that determination you showed during the training for the ball and the party?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.890
T-That's totally different from this situation, isn't it?!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.430
They're the same!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.730
Aren't you always living recklessly?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.770
If you really want to save Charl, then no matter what others may say...

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.280
...even if it's the president, it doesn't matter.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.210
What do <i>you</i> want to do?!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.190
I...  I...

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.930
Even so, is this the Arima Teppei that I fell for?

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.980
Se-Seika-san...

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:21.150
Looks like we're thinking the same thing.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.660
I never expected you to go that far.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.280
You saw...?

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:27.020
Sil---

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.750
What are you doing?!

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:33.480
Pathetic!  Are you <i>that</i> Arima Teppei?!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.130
And you call yourself the successor?!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.600
The same Arima Teppei that crossed swords with me?

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:46.400
The Arima Teppei that resolved the half century hatred between Arima and Houjouin?!

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:48.010
That's a totally different story!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.740
You can just whine all you want.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.240
I'm going to save Charl.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:58.140
Charl is now moving across Russia.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.680
The final destination is Hazelrink.

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:02.950
Just as I expected.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.380
Yes.  In order to save Charl I'll return to my country.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.580
I was thinking of asking you to come along but, too bad.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.700
Baton pass.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.810
From here on, it's your job.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.620
Teppei needs to be soothed by someone.

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:29.510
Please treat him gently.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:31.770
If it's that, then Seika-sama is better...

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.210
You're the person best suited for the task.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.000
Though it breaks my heart to admit it, that's not a job for me.

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:38.770
I'm going back to my country.

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:40.750
I want to save Charl.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:42.330
I understand.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.860
So, please do something about that dimwit.

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:46.620
I'm counting on you.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:48.710
I'll be counting on you.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.280
U-Umm...

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.190
Yuu-san...

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:33.690
Sto---

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.030
Teppei-sama...

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:49.750
It must've been hard, having Charl snatched away from you.

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.340
It's the same for me.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.120
Including Silvia-sama and Seika-sama.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:57.170
But,

00:15:57.290 --> 00:16:01.570
there's still some time left.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.200
There is still a chance, too.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:12.950
Damn...

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:15.120
Yuu-san, you're nice...

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:17.000
Teppei-sama.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:21.150
Compared to Silvie and Seika-san, their tone is so harsh.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:22.490
So rude.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:25.770
Yuu-san.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.650
The talk about Charl's place, fill me in.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:30.760
Yes.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.200
And...

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:34.090
Yes?

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.560
Can I, stay like this...just a little longer?

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:40.440
Yes.

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:03.330
Hartman-sama...

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.970
When it's just the two of us, call me Hartman.

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:11.330
There shouldn't be a need for that girl any longer, right?

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.290
The information should've reached Arima by now.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:21.810
When that Arima comes, that girl will just be a hindrance.

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:23.980
She still holds value.

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.550
Are you still thinking of marrying her?!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.000
I'm going to bed.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:36.890
I'll always be by your side, Hartman-sama!

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.290
Didn't I tell you to call me Hartman when it's just the two of us?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.660
Well, good night.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.510
Hey, where is this train going?

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.930
It seems as though we're passing through Russia.

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.020
Russia?

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:00.390
Then it means we're going back to Hazelrink?

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:01.850
Seems that way.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.300
What should I do?!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.810
W-What's wrong?

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:10.060
If we're heading to Hazelrink, then it's going to take a long time, right?

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.730
T-That's true.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.720
I want to take a bath!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.080
I haven't taken a bath since yesterday!

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:20.450
I want to take a bath!  A bath, a bath!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.940
You really have it with you, right?

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:27.460
This is not the time for that!  If you want to take a bath...

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.160
I-I guess so...

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.170
Besides, we're inside a train right now...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.970
It's a definite <i>no!</i>

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:35.690
A s-s-s-shower, you can take!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.430
A shower, you have such a thing, huh?

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.060
Yes!  If-If you want a shower then please---

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:44.740
Thank you, you're a lifesaver.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.440
N-No problem!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:54.110
Father...

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:59.020
I've heard it from Teppei's head maid.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.220
I'll return back to our country and take command.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:03.700
I will go too!

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:06.180
I won't allow that, Silvie.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.390
You stay in Japan.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:11.920
I'm very, very worried about you and Maria.

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:14.320
Therefore, you should get back with Teppei---

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:17.550
No...he will definitely save Charl.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:21.700
I want to be his support and help rescue Charl.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.560
Silvie...

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:28.430
I want to save my home country, with my own hands.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:32.070
Maria should come too, Fil'mish is a great country.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.380
You too will someday find happiness with the people of our nation.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:37.050
Sure!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.080
Maria...

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.590
If I'm with onee-chan, then I'll be fine.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:44.290
Besides, Teppei's coming too, right?

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:50.010
Listen well... It's just this once.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.490
And after that, we'll continue living in Japan.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.100
I won't give that up, okay?

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.330
That's what I have in mind, Father!

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.900
Thank you, it feels great!

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:20.820
R-Really?

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:24.030
If you say that, I'll gladly come in.

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.700
Is there anything you need?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.510
Don't peek!

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:40.200
You don't seem to understand your position.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:45.970
I'm saying don't be so cocky!

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:45.990
It hurts!  Stop!  It hurts!

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:55.520
I...will never run or hide.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:20:59.600
You little whore!

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:11.960
Where did you go?

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.120
Well, whatever.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:19.120
Anyway, did you leak the information about this train, Josephine?

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:23.900
Yes, but it's possible that it'll sound suspicious...

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:28.530
That's fine.  Even if it's suspicious, they have no choice but to come.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:33.730
Well then, hurry up and take my bait...Arima Teppei.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.320
Dad, Mom.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:43.090
I'm gonna do it, as I promised.

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:44.410
I'll manage it somehow.

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.600
I have a question, however.

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:28.460
What are those legs on Teppei-dono's bike?

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:30.900
Those are actually replicas of Charlotte-sama's legs.

00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:32.910
Now that you mention it, it does seem like it was stolen.

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:35.370
Next time on Princess Lover!  Cavalry and Train!

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.310
Coincidentally, they're warm like people and hang in mid air.

